  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu, when the blood veil covering an immemorial ruin bat corpse holds against the demonic path assault, rank seven Pi Shui Han clears space and activates this water path and ice path killer move. Over ten thousand Gu worms run in his immortal aperture while rank seven red date immortal essence is spent bead by bead. Waves roar out of thin air within hundreds of steps, then condense into ice from the inside out within several breaths and smash down like a falling pillar. The glacier deforms Dong Fang Chang Fan’s blood veil but cannot break it; that veil is built from eight Gu Immortals’ immortal aperture origin cores and site arrangements, so Pi Shui Han alone cannot force through. The surroundings around the ruin bat become glacier, and Fang Yuan judges that even all eight of his strength path giant hands would not stop the move head-on.",
      "chapters": [
        790
      ],
