    {
      "text": "When Pi Shui Han later waves a hand and tides freeze into glaciers against Hei Tie Sheng, a Hei tribe rank six Gu Immortal names the attack as Pi Shui Han’s signature killer move Flood Glacier. Black water covers the white glacier and breaks it apart in a few breaths, and Pi Shui Han spits blood and falls.",
